{"pages":[{"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612,"segs":[["W E E K LY",43.841199999999994,605.16369999999995,57.071200000000005,634.80870000000004,7,false],["M E E T I N G",43.841200000000001,567.3777,57.071200000000005,602.18869999999993,7,false],["L E A D E R S H I P 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,564.4027000000001,9,false],["GIVING LEADERSHIP TO",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,564.53999999999996,116.00059999999996,80,false],["THE WEEKLY MEETING",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,545.65999999999997,176.00059999999996,80,false],["student linc",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,289.94,194.10059999999999,20,false],["How the Weekly Meeting Team Fits into the",145.40000000000001,224.55639999999994,330.1160000000001,237.93939999999998,9,false],["Big Picture: The weekly meeting is the movement’s",145.40000000000001,237.55239999999992,343.52600000000001,250.93539999999996,9,false],["opportunity to present itself to the campus. It must",145.40000000000001,250.88139999999987,338.52200000000005,263.28339999999992,9,false],["demonstrate the Mission, Vision and Values of",145.40000000000001,263.87739999999985,321.95300000000009,276.2793999999999,9,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ. It needs to balance",145.40000000000001,276.87339999999995,324.17600000000004,289.27539999999993,9,false],["between being inviting to the non-Christian and",145.40000000000001,289.86939999999993,328.03700000000015,302.27139999999991,9,false],["encouraging to the Christian. Although it is not",145.40000000000001,302.86539999999991,323.53700000000015,315.2673999999999,9,false],["the movement, it is the face of the movement. It is",145.40000000000001,315.86139999999989,333.29300000000012,328.26339999999988,9,false],["an opportunity to teach, align and encourage the",145.40000000000001,328.85739999999987,327.94700000000006,341.25939999999986,9,false],["movement and present the gospel to the campus.",145.40000000000001,341.85339999999985,329.31500000000005,354.25539999999984,9,false],["Vision Statement, encouraging their team for their",369.20299999999997,224.86639999999989,561.37100000000009,237.26839999999993,9,false],["faithfulness and hard work. The weekly meeting",369.20299999999997,237.86239999999987,551.73200000000008,250.26439999999991,9,false],["should clearly reflect who we are.",369.20299999999997,250.85839999999985,495.34700000000004,263.26039999999989,9,false],["5. Brainstorm as a team. DO NOT do things just",369.20299999999997,276.85939999999994,547.97900000000004,289.26139999999992,9,false],["because we have done them before. Be creative and try",369.20299999999997,289.85539999999992,574.61900000000014,302.2573999999999,9,false],["new things, take risk.",369.20299999999997,302.8513999999999,449.24000000000001,315.25339999999989,9,false],["6. Delegate roles to faithful team members. Specific",369.20299999999997,328.85239999999988,563.23400000000004,341.25439999999986,9,false],["roles students play on the weekly meeting team are:",369.20299999999997,341.84839999999986,564.08900000000017,354.25039999999984,9,false],["Welcome and Greeters, Info Booth, Lights, Video,",369.20299999999997,354.84439999999984,555.80000000000018,367.24639999999982,9,false],["Testimonies, Slides, Sound Guys, Facilities guys to",369.20299999999997,367.84039999999982,560.52500000000009,380.2423999999998,9,false],["move chairs, Coffee and Food, etc. Recruit specifically",369.20299999999997,380.8363999999998,572.60300000000007,393.23839999999979,9,false],["for these roles.",369.20299999999997,393.83239999999978,424.93099999999998,406.23439999999977,9,false],["7. Evaluate as a team. What are we doing well? What",369.20299999999997,419.83339999999976,565.92499999999995,432.23539999999974,9,false],["can we improve?",369.20299999999997,432.82939999999974,432.5089999999999,445.23139999999972,9,false],["ROLES AND RESPONSIBILITIES OF WEEKLY",145.40000000000001,494.27440000000001,332.1400000000001,514.81439999999998,20,false],["MEETING TEAM LEADER",145.40000000000001,515.27440000000001,250.32000000000002,535.81439999999998,20,false],["Responsibilities of Weekly Meeting Team Leader:",145.40000000000001,534.88940000000002,334.41800000000006,547.29139999999995,9,false],["8. As a Leader you need to be recruiting and looking",369.20299999999997,458.83039999999971,563.4860000000001,471.2323999999997,9,false],["for ways to involve new members of your team.",369.20299999999997,471.82639999999969,546.35000000000002,484.22839999999968,9,false],["Discuss what the needs of the movement are with",369.20299999999997,484.82239999999967,556.61900000000014,497.22439999999966,9,false],["your team. Recruit at Fall Retreat and at weekly",369.20299999999997,497.81839999999966,549.39200000000005,510.22039999999964,9,false],["meeting.",369.20299999999997,510.81439999999964,402.43099999999998,523.21639999999957,9,false],["9. Have a Weekly Meeting Team Appreciation\/Vision",369.20299999999997,536.81539999999961,571.40600000000006,549.21739999999966,9,false],["dessert night once a quarter.",369.20299999999997,549.81139999999959,476.411,562.21339999999964,9,false],["1. This job will take 7-9 hrs\/week. 3-4 hours to plan or",145.40000000000001,560.8904,347.85500000000013,573.29240000000004,9,false],["carry out tasks during the week. 4-5 hours on Tuesday",145.40000000000001,573.88639999999998,349.52900000000011,586.28840000000002,9,false],["nights. Each week prepare announcements and meet",145.40000000000001,586.88239999999996,345.36200000000008,599.28440000000001,9,false],["with the MCs.",145.40000000000001,599.87840000000006,198.69799999999998,612.28039999999999,9,false],["10. Attend Servant Team Meetings once a quarter and",369.20299999999997,575.81239999999957,572.30600000000004,588.21439999999961,9,false],["Vision Planning times once a quarter.",369.20299999999997,588.80839999999966,511.26800000000003,601.21039999999971,9,false],["2. Stay on top of communicating with everyone who",145.40000000000001,625.87940000000003,341.20400000000006,638.28140000000008,9,false],["you’re working with.",145.40000000000001,638.87540000000001,223.20500000000001,651.27740000000006,9,false],["HELPFUL POINTS TO CONSIDER",369.20000000000005,629.27440000000001,506.94000000000005,649.81439999999998,20,false],["Here are some helpful points to consider:",369.20000000000005,648.88940000000002,524.90000000000009,661.29139999999995,9,false],["3. The leaders need to meet together to plan the",145.40000000000001,664.87639999999999,324.20300000000009,677.27840000000003,9,false],["weekly meeting every week.",145.40000000000001,677.87239999999997,251.20400000000006,690.27440000000001,9,false],["4. Leaders must keep the team aligned with the",145.40000000000001,703.87340000000006,323.20400000000006,716.27539999999999,9,false],["ministry’s Mission and Vision and the team’s",145.40000000000001,716.86940000000004,315.94100000000003,729.27140000000009,9,false],["Planning Meetings",369.20000000000005,674.55740000000003,449.17400000000004,687.94039999999995,9,false],["•",369.20000000000005,687.88639999999998,373.34000000000003,700.28840000000002,9,false],["Debrief the last weekly meeting, Evaluate how",387.20000000000005,687.88639999999998,562.34900000000016,700.28840000000002,9,false],["well the meeting is staying on track with the",387.20000000000005,700.88239999999996,553.92500000000018,713.28440000000001,9,false],["mission and vision of Crusade",387.20000000000005,713.87839999999994,501.39200000000005,726.28039999999999,9,false]]},{"h":792,"segs":[["•",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,45.836899999999901,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,150.54000000000002,71.828899999999862,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,72.4228999999998,150.54000000000002,84.824899999999843,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,85.41889999999978,150.54000000000002,97.820899999999824,9,false],["Plan the next meeting and address any upcoming",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,349.60200000000009,45.836899999999901,9,false],["issues",164.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,188.00700000000001,58.832899999999881,9,false],["Prepare announcements",164.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,258.14400000000001,71.828899999999862,9,false],["Brainstorm and think outside the box",164.40000000000001,72.4228999999998,306.00600000000009,84.824899999999843,9,false],["Pray for the weekly meeting",164.40000000000001,85.41889999999978,270.33000000000004,97.820899999999824,9,false],["Components of the Weekly Meeting",146.40000000000001,111.08689999999979,296.601,124.46989999999983,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,124.41589999999974,150.54000000000002,136.81789999999978,9,false],["Show up early (6:45) on Tuesdays to finalize",164.40000000000001,124.41589999999974,330.89100000000008,136.81789999999978,9,false],["details and prep",164.40000000000001,137.41189999999972,225.19499999999999,149.81389999999976,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,150.4078999999997,150.54000000000002,162.80989999999974,9,false],["Pray as a group at 7:00 for the meeting.",164.40000000000001,150.4078999999997,310.50600000000003,162.80989999999974,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,163.40389999999968,150.54000000000002,175.80589999999972,9,false],["Choose speakers",164.40000000000001,163.40389999999968,228.19200000000001,175.80589999999972,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,176.39989999999966,150.54000000000002,188.8018999999997,9,false],["Coach emcees: align for each meeting and relay",164.40000000000001,176.39989999999966,343.05000000000007,188.8018999999997,9,false],["announcements",164.40000000000001,189.39589999999964,226.13100000000003,201.79789999999969,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,202.39189999999962,150.54000000000002,214.79389999999967,9,false],["Coach different people participating in the",164.40000000000001,202.39189999999962,325.68000000000006,214.79389999999967,9,false],["meeting—testimonies, anyone getting on stage,",164.40000000000001,215.3878999999996,342.26700000000005,227.78989999999965,9,false],["greeters, info booth, etc.",164.40000000000001,228.38389999999958,255.23700000000002,240.78589999999963,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,241.37989999999957,150.54000000000002,253.78189999999961,9,false],["Communicate with other teams to see how they",164.40000000000001,241.37989999999957,344.78700000000009,253.78189999999961,9,false],["use weekly meeting as a platform for announcing",164.40000000000001,254.37589999999955,349.8900000000001,266.77789999999959,9,false],["an event they are coordinating.",164.40000000000001,267.37189999999953,281.47199999999998,279.77389999999957,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,280.36789999999962,150.54000000000002,292.76989999999961,9,false],["Make sure technical aspects are all in place",164.40000000000001,280.36789999999962,327.87600000000009,292.76989999999961,9,false],["Things to Remember",370.20299999999997,45.917899999999236,458.59199999999998,59.300899999999274,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,59.246899999999187,374.34299999999996,71.64889999999923,9,false],["Use “in-house” staff speakers as much as",388.20299999999997,59.246899999999187,542.202,71.64889999999923,9,false],["possible.",388.20299999999997,72.242899999999167,421.62899999999996,84.644899999999211,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,85.238899999999148,374.34299999999996,97.640899999999192,9,false],["Recruit teams or people to carry out elements of",388.20299999999997,85.238899999999148,570.30900000000008,97.640899999999192,9,false],["the meeting.",388.20299999999997,98.234899999999129,435.471,110.63689999999917,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,111.23089999999911,374.34299999999996,123.63289999999915,9,false],["Get different students on stage throughout the",388.20299999999997,111.23089999999911,563.505,123.63289999999915,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,137.22289999999907,374.34299999999996,149.62489999999912,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,176.21089999999901,374.34299999999996,188.61289999999906,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,267.18289999999888,374.34299999999996,279.58489999999892,9,false],["•",370.20299999999997,319.16689999999892,374.34299999999996,331.56889999999891,9,false],["year.",388.20299999999997,124.22689999999909,406.24799999999999,136.62889999999913,9,false],["Emphasize that the weekly meeting is NOT",388.20299999999997,137.22289999999907,552.53400000000011,149.62489999999912,9,false],["Campus Crusade in its entirety, simply a",388.20299999999997,150.21889999999905,541.18500000000006,162.6208999999991,9,false],["component of the movement",388.20299999999997,163.21489999999903,497.30099999999993,175.61689999999908,9,false],["Observe needs of the movement and add",388.20299999999997,176.21089999999901,540.84300000000007,188.61289999999906,9,false],["elements in the meeting to address these needs.",388.20299999999997,189.206899999999,568.16699999999992,201.60889999999904,9,false],["For example, speaker selection, topics, worship",388.20299999999997,202.20289999999898,566.97900000000004,214.60489999999902,9,false],["tone, and added elements. We must first know",388.20299999999997,215.19889999999896,561.822,227.600899999999,9,false],["where the movement as a whole desires to go (i.e.",388.20299999999997,228.19489999999894,573.49500000000012,240.59689999999898,9,false],["Renewal and Revival) and then set an agenda that",388.20299999999997,241.19089999999892,575.82600000000025,253.59289999999896,9,false],["can help accomplish this mission.",388.20299999999997,254.1868999999989,516.06600000000003,266.58889999999894,9,false],["Seek to bring about change. Think about",388.20299999999997,267.18289999999888,540.62699999999995,279.58489999999892,9,false],["involving the audience more, meet outside, and",388.20299999999997,280.17889999999898,566.51100000000008,292.58089999999896,9,false],["add different creative components from time to",388.20299999999997,293.17489999999896,567.61800000000005,305.57689999999894,9,false],["time.",388.20299999999997,306.17089999999894,407.81399999999996,318.57289999999892,9,false],["It is important to have a detail-oriented person",388.20299999999997,319.16689999999892,565.6110000000001,331.56889999999891,9,false],["but the team needs dreamers too",388.20299999999997,332.1628999999989,511.86300000000006,344.56489999999889,9,false],["Talk Content for Weekly Meeting",146.40000000000001,306.03589999999963,286.86300000000006,319.41889999999961,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,319.36489999999958,150.54000000000002,331.76689999999957,9,false],["The Big 11: The Gospel Message; Assurance",164.40000000000001,319.36489999999958,329.27100000000007,331.76689999999957,9,false],["of Salavation; Having a daily Quiet Time;",164.40000000000001,332.36089999999956,318.7410000000001,344.76289999999955,9,false],["Confessing our Sin; Being Empowered by God’s",164.40000000000001,345.35689999999954,343.70700000000005,357.75889999999953,9,false],["Spirit; How to Pray; Sharing Christ with others;",164.40000000000001,358.35289999999952,344.09400000000005,370.75489999999951,9,false],["The Great Commission; Biblical Community,",164.40000000000001,371.3488999999995,335.25600000000009,383.75089999999949,9,false],["Lordship of Christ; Eternal Perspective",164.40000000000001,384.34489999999948,313.57500000000005,396.74689999999947,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,397.34089999999946,150.54000000000002,409.74289999999945,9,false],["Take content from Cru.Comm and turn into a talk",164.40000000000001,397.34089999999946,352.12200000000007,409.74289999999945,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,410.33689999999945,150.54000000000002,422.73889999999943,9,false],["Talk series from Gospel of John or Ephesians",164.40000000000001,410.33689999999945,336.11100000000005,422.73889999999943,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,423.33289999999943,150.54000000000002,435.73489999999941,9,false],["Talk series on Attributes of God",164.40000000000001,423.33289999999943,284.85599999999999,435.73489999999941,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,436.32889999999941,150.54000000000002,448.73089999999939,9,false],["Biblical view of Sex and Relationships",164.