Gather announcements by Friday Night",164.40000000000001,527.30989999999929,315.54600000000005,539.71189999999933,9,false],["Contact Visual Arts Team if needed for posters\/",164.40000000000001,540.30589999999938,345.93900000000008,552.70789999999931,9,false],["fliers",164.40000000000001,553.30189999999925,184.083,565.70389999999929,9,false],["Coach the emcees – takes time and effort; make",164.40000000000001,566.29789999999934,343.45500000000004,578.69989999999939,9,false],["sure they understand the “why” behind every",164.40000000000001,579.29389999999933,335.03100000000006,591.69589999999937,9,false],["announcement",164.40000000000001,592.28989999999931,222.23400000000001,604.69189999999935,9,false],["Communicate with other teams who are involved",164.40000000000001,605.2858999999994,351.17700000000002,617.68789999999933,9,false],["in a particular Weekly Meeting",164.40000000000001,618.28189999999938,282.14700000000005,630.68389999999931,9,false],["Buy supplies that may be needed such as markers",164.40000000000001,631.27789999999936,350.9430000000001,643.67989999999941,9,false],["or batteries",164.40000000000001,644.27389999999946,208.30200000000002,656.67589999999939,9,false],["Deal with people wanting a “piece” of the Weekly",164.40000000000001,657.26989999999932,349.46699999999998,669.67189999999937,9,false],["Meeting and be able to say “NO” to many requests",164.40000000000001,670.26589999999942,352.17600000000004,682.66789999999935,9,false],["Delegate tasks that can be done by someone else",164.40000000000001,683.2618999999994,346.06500000000005,695.66389999999933,9,false],["team member",164.40000000000001,696.25789999999938,217.32900000000001,708.65989999999942,9,false],["Delegate Greeter Coordinator to a team member",164.40000000000001,709.25389999999936,347.51400000000001,721.65589999999941,9,false]],"w":612,"ocr":false},{"h":792,"segs":[["WEEKLY MEETING PLANNING SHEET",281.98320000000001,52.819899999999961,440.42320000000001,73.359899999999925,20,false],["Team Vision - To lead our movement to greater growth in the areas of win\/build send on a weekly basis.",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,536.82899999999972,97.836899999999901,9,false],["Pray.",146.40000000000001,111.43589999999983,165.44400000000002,123.83789999999988,9,false],["Emphasis for the Week of :",146.40000000000001,137.43689999999981,247.47900000000001,149.83889999999985,9,false],["Theme for this week :",146.40000000000001,176.43389999999977,227.82300000000001,188.83589999999981,9,false],["Details regarding the content, who’s responsible, and times for… (these might not all be done each week)",146.40000000000001,215.43089999999972,538.22399999999982,227.83289999999977,9,false],["Meeting Intro - The vision of CRU is to see movements everywhere so that every student knows someone",164.40000000000001,241.4318999999997,561.74099999999999,253.83389999999974,9,false],["who truly follows Christ.",164.40000000000001,254.42789999999968,258.57600000000002,266.82989999999972,9,false],["Announcements",164.40000000000001,293.42489999999981,227.83200000000002,305.8268999999998,9,false],["Conferences\/Projects",164.40000000000001,345.42689999999982,248.55000000000001,357.82889999999981,9,false],["Speaker",164.40000000000001,397.42889999999983,195.56700000000001,409.83089999999982,9,false],["Life story\/Vision spot",164.40000000000001,449.43089999999984,247.875,461.83289999999982,9,false],["Worship",164.40000000000001,501.43289999999985,197.45699999999999,513.83489999999983,9,false],["W E E K LY",43.841199999999994,605.87459999999999,57.071200000000005,635.51959999999997,7,false],["M E E T I N G",43.841200000000001,568.08860000000004,57.071200000000005,602.89959999999996,7,false],["L E A D E R S H I P 3",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,565.11360000000002,9,false],["What is the order of the meeting and how will we transition smoothly through its parts?",146.40000000000001,553.43489999999986,477.2940000000001,565.83689999999979,9,false],["How will we advertise for this week? Who, what, when, where?",146.40000000000001,605.43689999999992,383.55000000000007,617.83889999999985,9,false],["How will we pray for this week?",146.40000000000001,657.43889999999988,266.57700000000006,669.84089999999992,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612},{"w":612,"ocr":false,"h":792,"segs":[["SAMPLE WEEKLY MEETING (CRU) EVALUATION—END OF YEAR",223.3845,65.819899999999961,499.02449999999999,86.359899999999925,20,false],["What is the vision and purpose of Cru? When has it best achieved that vision?",146.40460000000002,124.10389999999984,471.81760000000008,137.48689999999988,9,false],["Good point of initial connection, Body Evangelism, unity of movement (ponds), alignment and vision, exposure",146.40460000000002,137.43289999999979,565.67859999999973,149.83489999999983,9,false],["to distinctives, spiritual refreshment and nourishment for students, momentum campus wide, place to hear",146.40460000000002,150.42889999999977,553.03359999999986,162.83089999999982,9,false],["the gospel, development of laborers and leaders, place for people to connect and “stick”, this fall was strong –",146.40460000000002,163.42489999999975,554.92359999999985,175.8268999999998,9,false],["distinctives were high, momentum was high.",146.40460000000002,176.42089999999973,315.58660000000009,188.82289999999978,9,false],["What have been strong points at Cru this year? Weak points? What keeps more students from coming?",146.40460000000002,202.08889999999974,575.94759999999997,215.47189999999978,9,false],["Variety of talks, hitting different distinctives, students sharing up front, good balance of fun and seriousness,",146.40460000000002,215.41789999999969,555.83259999999996,227.81989999999973,9,false],["increased student ownership, tried new things and venues, clipboards were mostly good, Jr. Ballroom worked",146.40460000000002,228.41389999999967,558.9556,240.81589999999971,9,false],["out well Too much moving around, auditorium, community building and connection, band – especially since Ho",146.40460000000002,241.40989999999965,568.18059999999969,253.8118999999997,9,false],["Sung, communication by the band during the meeting, need more humor. Band, moving around, length of Cru",146.40460000000002,254.40589999999963,557.97459999999978,266.80789999999968,9,false],["could be too long – keep it to 1:15 long, environment not aesthetically strong, student leaders don’t own Cru and",146.40460000000002,267.40189999999961,565.39059999999984,279.80389999999966,9,false],["don’t think about how they could help make it a good meeting, humor and crowd interaction is relatively low still",146.40460000000002,280.39789999999971,570.49359999999979,292.7998999999997,9,false],["How has the band helped\/hindered towards the vision? How have the mc’s done? What is the overall",146.40460000000002,306.06589999999971,566.4255999999998,319.4488999999997,9,false],["feel from talks at Cru?",146.40460000000002,319.0618999999997,240.05860000000001,332.44489999999968,9,false],["Better alignment with band could help, communication skills from the front.",146.40460000000002,332.39089999999965,435.41260000000017,344.79289999999963,9,false],["Gotten better as a team, students keep asking to hear from those they don’t hear from, incorporated wider variety",146.40460000000002,345.38689999999963,572.87860000000001,357.78889999999961,9,false],["of type of talks, students like knowing what we are going to be speaking on (for a whole month).",146.40460000000002,358.38289999999961,504.46059999999994,370.7848999999996,9,false],["To improve: creative elements, addressing defeaters, speaking with a prophetic voice",146.40460000000002,371.37889999999959,466.71460000000025,383.78089999999958,9,false],["What has been under\/over represented at Cru (student stories, videos, “distinctives”, movement",146.40460000000002,397.0468999999996,551.8005999999998,410.42989999999958,9,false],["vision, heart, humor, prayer , social connection, promotion and recruiting to events, other)?",146.40460000000002,410.04289999999958,531.7485999999999,423.42589999999956,9,false],["More humor, still need more distinctives, present the mission at beginning of meeting: “everyone knows someone",146.40460000000002,423.37189999999953,574.74160000000006,435.77389999999951,9,false],["who truly follows Jesus”",146.40460000000002,436.36789999999951,239.39259999999999,448.7698999999995,9,false],["What should we do about venue and the cost?",146.40460000000002,462.03589999999951,336.67360000000008,475.4188999999995,9,false],["Todd Auditorium is great, have lights lower and less on band during worship",146.40460000000002,475.36489999999947,433.98160000000013,487.76689999999945,9,false],["W E E K LY",43.841199999999994,606.27070000000003,57.071200000000005,635.91570000000002,7,false],["M E E T I N G",43.841200000000001,568.48469999999998,57.071200000000005,603.29570000000001,7,false],["L E A D E R S H I P 4",43.841200000000001,509.5,57.071200000000005,565.50970000000007,9,false],["What is one thing we should be sure to do\/change in the fall?",146.40460000000002,501.03289999999947,398.92660000000001,514.41589999999951,9,false],["Good band to start the year – one of the most important things to be “sticky”",146.40460000000002,514.36189999999942,433.02760000000023,526.76389999999947,9,false],["Student leadership own meeting and be intentional while at Cru",146.40460000000002,527.3578999999994,388.87360000000024,539.75989999999945,9,false],["Have prof share at first meeting",146.40460000000002,540.35389999999938,265.87960000000004,552.75589999999943,9,false],["Shorter meetings with social attached afterwards – especially early in the year",146.40460000000002,553.34989999999948,442.61260000000016,565.75189999999941,9,false],["Platform student leaders (and emerging leaders) at Cru more",146.40460000000002,566.34589999999946,377.23660000000012,578.74789999999939,9,false]]}]}